OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for police to stop
OL,4,Ausing Tasers on children in custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Tasers were used against children
OL,7,Fin 2023/34 it was not in custody,
OL,8,Fhowever police legally still have the
OL,9,Foption to use the devices there if
OL,10,Frequired.
